# Production build configuration, committed deliberately.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ values are inlined into the JavaScript bundle and are public by definition, so nothing secret belongs here. Local development overrides these in .env, which is gitignored.

EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://mycompanion.pet/api

# Since SDK 56, Expo installs its own spec-compliant fetch as the global, and that implementation rejects React Native's { uri, name, type } multipart parts - which is the only shape RN can produce for a local file, so photo upload breaks without this. Streaming opts into expo/fetch explicitly in api/chat.ts instead.
EXPO_PUBLIC_USE_RN_FETCH=1